{% set council = rules.council %}
{% if kind == "doomsday" %}
Doomsday clock {{ doom }}/{{ doom_threshold }}: what will the gods do about it?
{% elif kind == "rebel" %}
{{ subject }}'s rebellion against the Creator: does the council stand with the rebel or against them?
{% elif kind == "dead_sibling" %}
The dead sibling {{ subject }}: what do the gods do now that they are gone?
{% elif kind == "war" %}
{{ subject }}: will the gods take sides in the mortals' war?
{% elif kind == "open_thread" %}
{% if subject | length > council.agenda_thread_max_chars %}
{% set head = subject[:council.agenda_cut_chars] %}
{% set boundary = head.rfind(" ") %}
Unresolved story: {{ (head[:boundary] if boundary > 0 else head) }}…
{% else %}
Unresolved story: {{ subject }}
{% endif %}
{% else %}
The course of the world: what should the gods do next?
{% endif %}
